        <span style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;padding:14px 12px;">Old inverter, weak batteries: inverter and battery installation</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/commercial-solar/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(27,29,42,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-3.webp" alt="Solar panels on the roof of a small commercial building" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;padding:14px 12px;">Diesel eating the shop or clinic: commercial solar</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/solar-inverter-repair/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(27,29,42,0.1);">
