        <span style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;padding:14px 12px;">System keeps tripping: solar and inverter repair</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/lithium-vs-tubular-battery/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(27,29,42,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-1.webp" alt="Lithium and tubular batteries side by side" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;padding:14px 12px;">Tubular batteries failing: is lithium worth it?</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/solar-generator-vs-inverter-system/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(27,29,42,0.1);">
