        <span style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;padding:14px 12px;">What a 5 kVA inverter needs in panels and batteries</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/solar-panel-price-nigeria/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(27,29,42,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/tile-4.webp" alt="Stack of solar panels at a Lagos dealer" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;padding:14px 12px;">What solar panels cost in Nigeria right now</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
