  @media (max-width: 520px) { .tile-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>

<!-- SERVICE CARDS -->
<section style="padding:0 24px 80px;background:#FAF5EA;">
  <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="svc-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <a href="/home-solar-installation/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">Home Solar Installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Hybrid inverter, battery and panels sized from the rating plates of your own appliances. For a duplex or flat in Lagos or Abuja that wants to stop feeding the gen.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B4501A;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/inverter-battery-installation/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">Inverter and Battery Installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">For an old inverter whose tubular batteries no longer last the night. Ask for lithium and tubular options quoted side by side, with the exact battery model on paper.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B4501A;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/commercial-solar/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">Commercial Solar</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">For a shop, school, clinic, church or small office trying to cut diesel. The installer starts with a load assessment and agrees the changeover arrangement in writing.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B4501A;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/solar-inverter-repair/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">Solar and Inverter Repair</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">For a system that keeps tripping or a battery bank that has gone weak. An installer should check wiring, protection and settings before blaming the equipment.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B4501A;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr) !important; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>

<!-- WHY -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="why-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">What Makes Us Different</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 28px;">A quote process built on exact models, dated prices and installer checks</h2>
      <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B4501A" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 4px;">Quotes that name the exact models</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Every enquiry is pushed toward a written quote listing the inverter, battery and panel models, the warranty terms and the VAT treatment, so two or three quotes can be compared line by line.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B4501A" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 4px;">Prices shown with the seller and the month</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">When this site quotes a number it names who published it and when, for example Mercury Direct listing a 3.5 kVA lithium package at N3,400,000 in October 2026. It is never presented as this site's quote.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B4501A" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 4px;">Installer checks you can run yourself</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">NEMSA keeps a public directory of certified electrical contractors at nemsa.gov.ng/directory/. Ask for the competency certificate and look the installer up before you pay a deposit.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B4501A" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 4px;">No savings promises</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Payback is never guaranteed here. Where a comparison is useful, such as petrol spend against a system price, the working is shown and labelled as an illustration.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
