<!-- PROCESS -->
<section style="padding:76px 24px;background:#FAF5EA;">
  <div style="max-width:1020px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">How It Works</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin:0 0 44px;">Three Steps: Size, Quote, Install.</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(27,29,42,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#B4501A;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">Enquiry and technical discussion</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">You call now or send your location, your appliances and what you want them to run through (AC, freezer, pumping machine). An independent installer discusses it with you and notes what the rating plates say.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(27,29,42,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#B4501A;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">Site survey and scope</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">The installer visits to check the roof, the DB, the earthing and where the batteries will sit. The scope, system size and any changeover work are agreed from that visit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(27,29,42,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#B4501A;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 10px;">Written proposal and delivery</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">You get a written proposal naming each model, the warranty terms, the VAT treatment and the schedule. Compare it with two other quotes before you commit, and keep every receipt.</p>
